{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:ef1e47593524dda3","name":"Quiet the Mind","source":{"id":"source:reference-ef1e47593524dda3","title":"Quiet the Mind","revision":20505,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:59:11Z","sha256":"f119e79cdc3c42b910731bf7beff963ac182ba723356603f1d14b4494c4954f4","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20505","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Quiet%20the%20Mind&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-ef1e47593524dda3","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Academy Training Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["This Training Regimen trains you to block out distractions and stray thoughts. It requires little more than finding a quiet, secluded spot and slipping into a meditative trance to clear your mind of doubt, questions, fear, and the chaos of the galaxy. Jedi use this technique to open themselves to the flow of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"},", allowing them to see distant places and events.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Time:"]}," 1 Hour\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Targets:"]}," Self\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check."]}," The result of the check determines the benefits of the regimen:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["DC\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["EFFECT\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["13\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You meditate, but your mind is still clouded by external stimuli. You can add one use of the ",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Farseeing"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Farseeing","referenceId":"reference:efdb098bc15b650e"}]}," Force Power to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power Suite"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power_Suite"},", but once it is used, it cannot be regained by any means.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["18\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You meditate, quieting your mind except for but a few small distractions. You can add one use of the ",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Farseeing"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Farseeing","referenceId":"reference:efdb098bc15b650e"}]}," Force Power to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power Suite"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power_Suite"},".\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["23\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You meditate, quieting your mind entirely. You can add one use of the ",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Farseeing"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Farseeing","referenceId":"reference:efdb098bc15b650e"}]}," Force Power to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power Suite"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power_Suite"},", and you gain the benefits of the ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Visions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Visions"}]}," Talent (if you do not already know it).\n"]}]}]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
